1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
You can easily use shortcuts inside of the ChatGPT user interface

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:05,260
so that you can go and do things

3
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:07,180
such as toggle the sidebar like this,

4
00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:11,400
or even have a look at all the individual shortcuts.

5
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:13,900
Hit Control, forward slash,

6
00:00:14,220 --> 00:00:16,720
or if you're on Mac, hit Command, forward slash.

7
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:17,980
You will then be presented

8
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:19,860
with something called keyboard shortcuts.

9
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:22,480
As you can see, I was just toggling the sidebar.

10
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:25,380
We can also do other things such as deleting the chat,

11
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,540
opening a new chat, focusing the chat input,

12
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:31,640
or even copying the last response or the last code block.

13
00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:33,140
Hopefully, this will help you

14
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:34,720
to speed up your ChatGPT workplace.
